-- Migration: 0152_index_backfill.sql
-- RLS-Posture: tenant-scoped
-- Tenant-Column: tenant_id
-- Indexes only, on existing tenant-policied tables.
-- Index backfill (audit P1 #161), generated from live catalog
-- introspection: every join-bearing FK column (patient_id,
-- encounter_id, tenant_id, ...) that had no index with it as the
-- leading column — actor columns (*_by) deliberately excluded to
-- avoid write amplification on audit-ish references. Plus
-- (tenant_id, status) composites on the hot workflow tables.
--
-- Plain CREATE INDEX (not CONCURRENTLY): runs inside the embedded
-- startup migration transaction. At Starter-tier data volumes each
-- index builds in well under a second; revisit with CONCURRENTLY out
-- of band before running against a multi-GB production table.

